        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every Dhanbad‑to‑Pune relocation includes IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % of the declared value of your goods. The policy protects against loss, theft, and damage during loading, transit, and unloading. You can also opt for higher coverage limits for high‑value items such as electronics, artwork, or antique furniture.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time during the Dhanbad to Pune move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our dedicated highway containers are equipped with satellite GPS units that provide live location updates on a secure portal. You receive a tracking link via SMS or email, allowing you to monitor the exact position of your belongings, vehicle carriers, and any interim stops, ensuring full transparency throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for Packers And Movers Dhanbad To Pune calculated and what factors influence it?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost is based on the total volume of goods (measured in cubic feet), distance, type of packaging required, and any special handling such as vehicle carrier or fragile item crating. Additional factors include insurance coverage, stair‑case or elevator access, and any optional services like carpentry or assembly. Our transparent quote breaks down each component for clear understanding.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any items that cannot be transported on the Dhanbad‑to‑Pune route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, hazardous materials like flammable liquids, explosives, and certain chemicals are prohibited by law. We also restrict the transport of perishable food items without proper refrigeration, live animals, and unregistered firearms. Our pre‑move checklist highlights all restricted items, ensuring compliance with Indian transport regulations and safeguarding your move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What preparation steps should I take at home before the Packers And Movers Dhanbad To Pune team arrives?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Start by decluttering and donating items you no longer need. Label each box with room and content details, and disassemble large furniture using our on‑site carpentry service if required. Secure valuables in a personal bag, ensure all appliances are unplugged, and create a clear pathway for the loading crew. Following this checklist speeds up loading and reduces the risk of damage.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
